---
config:
    theme: base
    themeVariables:
        actorBkg: '#E3F2FD'
        actorBorder: '#1565C0'
        actorTextColor: '#0D47A1'
        signalColor: '#455A64'
        signalTextColor: '#263238'
        noteBkgColor: '#FFFDE7'
        noteBorderColor: '#FBC02D'
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser app
    participant D as External device
    participant F as Firestore
    participant I as postEvent
    participant T as onEventCreate
    participant G as Scoring engine
    participant S as score/current
    participant A as Public API
    participant O as Overlay / read client
    participant K as Callable functions

    alt Browser scoring action
        B->>F: addDoc courts/{courtId}/events/{eventId}
    else External device action
        D->>I: POST /postEvent
        I->>F: append event + server timestamp
    end

    F-->>T: Event document created
    T->>F: Read court + event + score/current in transaction
    T->>T: Check scoreVersion and event ordering

    alt Out-of-order event or UNDO
        T->>G: Full event-history replay
    else Normal scoring event
        T->>G: Apply/replay scoring state
    end

    G-->>T: Materialized score
    T->>F: Write score/current
    T->>F: Write checkpoint when required
    F-->>S: Updated live score document
    S-->>B: onSnapshot live score

    opt Public scoreboard / overlay
        O->>A: GET /r/{courtId}
        A->>S: Read current score
        A-->>O: Revision payload

        O->>A: GET /a/{courtId}
        A->>S: Read current score
        A-->>O: Live score payload

        O->>A: GET /s or /m/{courtId}
        A->>F: Replay active court event history
        A-->>O: Statistics / momentum payload
    end

    opt Callable resetCourt
        B->>K: httpsCallable resetCourt
        K->>F: Archive active events
        K->>F: Delete active events + checkpoints
        K->>F: Reset score/current
        K->>F: Increment court scoreVersion
    end

    Note over K,F: Current callable handlers do not perform explicit request.auth authorization checks
    Note over D,I: Current device identity is deviceId/binding only; HMAC + freshness + idempotency are production targets
    Note over F,S: score/current is derived state; courts/{courtId}/events is the authoritative scoring history
